{
  "id": "03925_shibaru",
  "headword": "{縛|しば}る",
  "reading": "しばる",
  "part_of_speech": "godan verb",
  "gloss": "to tie, to bind, to restrict",
  "conjugation": {
    "type": "godan",
    "ending": "る",
    "stem": "{縛|しば}"
  },
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to tie, to bind",
      "explanation": "To fasten with rope, string, or other material."
    },
    {
      "sense_number": 2,
      "gloss": "to restrict, to constrain",
      "explanation": "To limit freedom or impose restrictions."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "03925_shibaru_ex1",
      "japanese": "ロープで{荷物|にもつ}を{縛|しば}る。",
      "english": "Tie the luggage with a rope.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "03925_shibaru_ex2",
      "japanese": "{彼|かれ}は{古|ふる}い{慣習|かんしゅう}に{縛|しば}られている。",
      "english": "He is bound by old customs.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "03925_shibaru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{新聞|しんぶん}を{紐|ひも}で{縛|しば}って{捨|す}てる。",
      "english": "Bundle up newspapers with string and throw them away.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "03925_shibaru_ex4",
      "japanese": "{段|だん}ボールを{紐|ひも}で{縛|しば}ってまとめた。",
      "english": "I tied up the cardboard boxes with string.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "03925_shibaru_ex5",
      "japanese": "ルールに{縛|しば}られすぎると{自由|じゆう}がなくなる。",
      "english": "If you are too bound by rules, you lose your freedom.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "03925_shibaru_ex6",
      "japanese": "{時間|じかん}に{縛|しば}られない{生活|せいかつ}がしたい。",
      "english": "I want to live a life not bound by time.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "{縛|しば}る means to tie or bind something with rope or string.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Transitive ({他動詞|たどうし})\n- Pair: {縛|しば}られる (passive - to be tied, bound)\n- Pattern: Xを{縛|しば}る、Xで{縛|しば}る\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ロープで{縛|しば}る (to tie with rope)\n- {紐|ひも}で{縛|しば}る (to tie with string)\n- ルールに{縛|しば}られる (to be bound by rules)\n- {時間|じかん}に{縛|しば}られる (to be restricted by time)\n- {縛|しば}り{付|つ}ける (to tie down firmly)\n\nRELATED VOCABULARY:\n- {結|むす}ぶ (to tie, to make a knot)\n- {括|くく}る (to bundle, to tie together)",
